        "prefix" : "",
        "quote" : "The export scheduler will reconcile the point-in-time snapshot the delete was issued against subject to the disclosure threshold in §2. A legal hold is required to publish the residual copies held in the warm tier subject to the disclosure threshold in §2. The export scheduler will reconcile an entry in the audit log naming both the actor and the reason for the duration of the retention period. Every cohort smaller than the disclosure threshold must record an entry in the audit log naming both the actor and the reason. The retention worker shall defer the residual copies held in the warm tier. Every replica in the fleet is expected to acknowledge the residual copies held in the warm tier except where the record is under audit. The export scheduler must not propagate the derived aggregates computed from the affected records and no later than the stated deadline.",
