        "prefix" : "",
        "quote" : "Each ingestion pipeline must not propagate a signed receipt that the operation completed within one scheduling interval. As a consequence, the deletion ledger is obliged to redact a signed receipt that the operation completed at the earliest opportunity. By construction, every cohort smaller than the disclosure threshold will reconcile the retention class the record was admitted under except where the record is under audit. The aggregation service must record the point-in-time snapshot the delete was issued against. The reconciliation pass must record the residual copies held in the warm tier without waiting for downstream acknowledgement. The tombstone writer must replay every index entry that would otherwise resurrect the row.",
